<title>USA: AES Corp starts $275mln private note offer.</title>
<headline>AES Corp starts $275mln private note offer.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AES Corp said Thursday it had started a private offering of $275 million of senior subordinated notes due 2007.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the proceeds to redeem its outstanding 9.75 percent senior subordinated notes due 2000 and to finance certain short-term acquisition indebtness.</p>
<p>A company official was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The notes have not been registered under the Securities Act of 1933, the company said.</p>
